  "extract": "James Gordon Farrell was an English-born novelist of Irish descent. He gained prominence for a series of novels known as \"the Empire Trilogy\", which deal with the political and human consequences of British colonial rule.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>James Gordon Farrell</b> was an English-born novelist of Irish descent. He gained prominence for a series of novels known as \"the Empire Trilogy\", which deal with the political and human consequences of British colonial rule.</p>"
